---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') 
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1) 
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="metodo" class="what-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="tag">Principio Clínico & Método en 2 Pasos</span>
      <h2>El Método Valeria+: <span class="gradient-text">Aprender antes de ejercitar</span></h2>
      <p>Primero capacita al cuidador para modelar el habla en el hogar y después facilita la práctica lúdica en casa guiada por Lúa.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="what-content-layout">
      <!-- Screenshot Phone Mockup -->
      <div class="screenshot-col">
        <div class="device-frame">
          <img 
            src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria-screen-academy.png`} 
            alt="Pantalla de formación para familias en Academy de Valeria+" 
            class="manual-screenshot" 
            width="460"
            height="1024"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <span class="screenshot-chip">1.º Formación Parental · Academy</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Core Pillars Bento Grid -->
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="glass-card feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper purple">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
              <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>1. Primero Formar (Academy)</h3>
          <p>
            Cápsulas de <strong>2 minutos</strong> para madres y padres. Técnicas de modelado verbal positivo (<em>recast</em>) y turnos de habla sin regañinas.
          </p>
          <span class="card-tag">Aprender para Acompañar</span>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper cyan">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>2. Adulto al Mando (MDR Clase I)</h3>
          <p>
            Cero diagnósticos automáticos. La app asiste con ASR local, pero el adulto siempre <strong>valida o matiza</strong> el acierto con un toque.
          </p>
          <span class="card-tag">Criterio Humano Innegociable</span>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper emerald">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>3. 100% Offline (Zero-PHI)</h3>
          <p>
            Retiro total de Firebase y servidores. Voces neuronales y modelos operan en local: las grabaciones <strong>nunca se almacenan ni viajan a la nube</strong>.
          </p>
          <span class="card-tag">Privacidad Infantil Estricta</span>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card feature-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper amber">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>4. Práctica en Doble Vuelta</h3>
          <p>
            Diferencia <strong>comprensión</strong> (señalar la imagen correcta) de <strong>producción</strong> (hablar). Cero frustración si aún hay dificultad motora.
          </p>
          <span class="card-tag">Comprensión vs. Articulación</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .what-content-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .screenshot-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .device-frame {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .manual-screenshot {
    width: 280px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 28px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 45px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
  }

  .screenshot-chip {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-wrapper.cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
  }

  .icon-wrapper.purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    color: #C084FC;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
  }

  .icon-wrapper.emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    color: #6EE7B7;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }

  .icon-wrapper.amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    color: #FCD34D;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .what-content-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .screenshot-col {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
